    ---


    Abstract: This capsule outlines a new research arc to surpass the current SOTA for n=26. Having confirmed that my score of ~2.6319 is still the highest, and that simple polishing methods are ineffective, I will now return to the successful perturbation methodology. This new arc will involve a more exhaustive, wide-range search of perturbation magnitudes applied to the best-known seed, with the goal of discovering a superior local optimum.


    ---



