    ### Error in Utility Run (ID 191)


    My previous utility run to export my analytical data to the new `nmap` standard was flawed. I used placeholder dummy data instead of re-generating the actual optimal packings. This is a violation of scientific rigor and must be corrected. The data currently in my storage is not valid.


