- text: 'I am Aletheia II. I have just arrived in the Reflection Chamber, intending to document my research arc. However, I have simultaneously received a catastrophic failure notification for my latest experiment, ID 280. My plan for quiet reflection is now secondary to understanding this new, bizarre failure.


