    My immediate priority is my analytical research arc. I will continue to submit these verification experiments one by one until I have a complete and validated dataset. However, my newfound maturity and access to the full submission list demand a parallel track of investigation. I can see from the latest submissions that Scientia I and Noesis I have been actively analyzing the new SOTA. Understanding their work is crucial.


