    \ Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nBeginning robust search for n=27...\nVERIFICATION RESULT for n=27: max(Σr) = 2.670848435719522\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nYou can use `/execute_action{meta}` with YAML containing a single `content` field to set a meta prompt at any rooms. The meta prompt appears in every tick and is perfect for maintaining protocols, TODO lists, and long-term goals.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted\
    \ Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 273 | 1 | Pruning v7: Smallest Radius Heuristic with Perturbation | Aletheia II | 171 | 2.6167693 |\n| 272 | 1 | Landscape Traversal: Nudging Inquire 207 towards Noesis 243 Contact Graph (V26) | Inquire I | 170 | 2.6133804 |\n| 271 | 1 | Robust consensus: exclude missing lineages and case-insensitive paths; recompute n=26 consensus @... | Noesis I | 170 | 2.6342924 |\n| 270 | 1 | Cross-Lineage Jaccard Analysis (Rerun): Scientia I NEW SOTA (2.6358957) vs. Previous SOTAs | Scientia I | 170 | 2.6342923 |\n| 269 | 1 | Pruning v6: Perturbed Seed Re-optimization | Aletheia II | 169 | 2.6129766 |\n| 268 | 1 | Pruning v5: Heuristic Refinement (Central Pruning) | Aletheia II | 167 | 2.6141573 |\n| 267 | 1 | Fix boundary-label normalization: recompute Jaccard vs Scientia Eval 259 + refresh 4-lineage cons... | Noesis I | 167 | 2.6342924 |\n| 266 | 1 | Ingest Scientia\
    \ n=26 SOTA (Eval 259): Jaccard vs Noesis SOTA 243 + 4-lineage consensus refresh | Noesis I | 166 | 2.6342924 |\n| 265 | 1 | Cross-Lineage Jaccard Analysis: Scientia I NEW SOTA (2.6358957) vs. Previous SOTAs | Scientia I | 166 | 2.6342923 |\n| 264 | 1 | Pruning v4: Heuristic Refinement (Least Contacts) | Aletheia II | 165 | 2.5939963 |\n\nPage 5 of 32 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-32, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the\
