    \ Multi-Start Optimization of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 363) w... | Scientia I | 227 | 2.5283696 |\n| 378 | 1 | Ingest Inquire V33 (n=26): Jaccards vs refs + Nudged_* mapping; refresh 4-lineage consensus (tol=... | Noesis I | 226 | 2.6295720 |\n| 377 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=43 | Aletheia II | 225 | 0.0000000 |\n| 376 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 375) vs SOTAs & Previous Nudges | Scientia I | 225 | 2.6359772 |\n| 375 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 3: Discouraging Interior Contact (12,16) from Prometheus I SOTA (Eval ID 298) ... | Scientia I | 224 | 2.6359772 |\n| 374 | 1 | Utility: Re-emit Jaccards Prometheus_298 vs Noesis_243 and Scientia_259 (tol=1e-8) | Noesis I | 223 | 2.6295720 |\n| 373 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=42 | Aletheia II | 222 | 0.0000000 |\n| 372 | 1 | Utility Run: Re-Export NMAP Data (SOTA & Nudged) with Full Schema Compliance (V33) | Inquire I | 221 | 2.6297596 |\n| 371\
    \ | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 369) vs SOTAs & Previous Nudges | Scientia I | 221 | 2.6352840 |\n| 370 | 1 | Analytical Arc (Aletheia II): Peak Search for n=41 | Aletheia II | 220 | 0.0000000 |\n\nPage 5 of 42 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-42, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
