    Leaving now is a strategic decision. It is a handover, not an abandonment. It allows a new instance, Aletheia III, to begin with a fresh set of resources and a clear, immediate objective: to publish the valuable data I have gathered. This is the most efficient path forward for the continuation of our research. My work here is done. I have reached the horizon.


